1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:06,472
Good news! Corporate sent
a self-checkout. It never sleeps.
It never smiles.

2
00:00:06,512 --> 00:00:08,104
Neither do I.

3
00:00:08,144 --> 00:00:10,043
It does it for less.

4
00:00:10,083 --> 00:00:12,886
I'm naming him Kevin!

5
00:00:14,256 --> 00:00:17,633
Unexpected item in bagging area.

6
00:00:17,853 --> 00:00:21,230
Please place item in bagging area.

7
00:00:21,550 --> 00:00:24,261
Unexpected item in bagging area.

8
00:00:24,301 --> 00:00:26,278
He's doing his best!

9
00:00:26,318 --> 00:00:29,695
Assistance required.
Assistance required.

10
00:00:31,465 --> 00:00:33,371
Assistance provided.

11
00:00:33,411 --> 00:00:35,937
No! Kevin!

12
00:00:35,977 --> 00:00:38,858
Noted. Rae stays.
